<section>
  <grid spacing="none">
    <grid-item colspan="7" background-color="accent" padding="34pt 12pt 30pt">
      <p role="eyebrow">Field guide</p>
      <spacer mode="fill"/>
      <p role="caption">DECISIONS</p>
      <p role="caption">06 / 10</p>
    </grid-item>
    <grid-item colspan="53" padding="32pt 40pt 30pt 36pt">
      <labels><label variant="outline">Illustrative replacement · validate before use</label></labels>
      <h2>Decisions protect the project from repeating old debates</h2>
      <p>Decision IDs remain stable when dates, owners, or evidence links change.</p>
      <grid spacing="medium" vertical-sizing="fill">
        <grid-item colspan="27">
          <grid direction="vertical" spacing="small" vertical-sizing="fill">
            <grid-item cell-style="subtle">
              <labels><label variant="plain">D-01 · ACCEPTED</label></labels>
              <h4>Eight-category taxonomy</h4>
              <p font-size="sm">Chosen over team-specific labels. Local teams map their language into shared categories rather than create new queues.</p>
            </grid-item>
            <grid-item cell-style="subtle">
              <labels><label variant="plain">D-02 · ACCEPTED</label></labels>
              <h4>Supervisor-only priority overrides</h4>
              <p font-size="sm">Improves auditability. Urgent exceptions require an available supervisor and a recorded reason.</p>
            </grid-item>
            <grid-item cell-style="subtle">
              <labels><label variant="plain">D-03 · ACCEPTED</label></labels>
              <h4>Phased rollout</h4>
              <p font-size="sm">Two teams launch first. Delivery is slower, but exposure and rollback boundaries are measurable.</p>
            </grid-item>
          </grid>
        </grid-item>
        <grid-item colspan="33" background-color="palette-2" padding="26pt 28pt">
          <p role="eyebrow">D-04 · OPEN · DRIVEN BY R-02</p>
          <h3>Is reporting ready enough for launch?</h3>
          <p>Choose between launching with a controlled daily export or delaying until the two-hour refresh target is met.</p>
          <grid divider="sm neutral-border" vertical-sizing="hug">
            <grid-item colspan="30">
              <p role="eyebrow">Accountable</p>
              <h4>Product Owner</h4>
            </grid-item>
            <grid-item colspan="30">
              <p role="eyebrow">Evidence owner</p>
              <h4>Data Lead</h4>
            </grid-item>
            <grid-item colspan="30">
              <p role="eyebrow">A-06 · Next action</p>
              <p font-size="sm">Representative-volume benchmark by T+5.</p>
            </grid-item>
            <grid-item colspan="30">
              <p role="eyebrow">Decision forum</p>
              <h4>T+6</h4>
            </grid-item>
          </grid>
          <p font-size="sm"><b>Launch:</b> preserves schedule, adds manual reconciliation. <b>Delay:</b> protects the reporting standard, extends dual operation.</p>
        </grid-item>
      </grid>
    </grid-item>
  </grid>
</section>